OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1785761309
OL,3,CLondon mayor's office acted lawfully
OL,4,Cwhen blocking Met Palantir deal, court
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FPart of London mayor Sir Sadiq Khan's
OL,8,Foffice has told the High Court that
OL,9,Fblocking the Metropolitan Police's #50
OL,10,Fmillion deal with technology firm
OL,11,FPalantir was the only decision that it
OL,12,F"could lawfully and/or realistically
OL,13,Freach".
OL,15,FIn May, the Mayor's Office for
OL,16,FPolicing and Crime (Mopac) blocked the
OL,17,FMet's move to agree a two-year deal
OL,18,Fwith Palantir to provide artificial
OL,19,Fintelligence technology to automate
OL,20,Fintelligence analysis in criminal
OL,21,Finvestigations.
OL,26,@tD@AOUuD@FO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G1/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,377,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37602
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1785761309
OL,3,CLondon mayor's office acted lawfully
OL,4,Cwhen blocking Met Palantir deal, court
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FIt claimed that Palantir was the only
OL,8,Fsupplier the Met had seriously
OL,9,Fconsidered for the proposed contract,
OL,10,Fand the force failed to present its
OL,11,Fprocurement strategy to Mopac for
OL,12,Fapproval in a "clear and serious
OL,13,Fbreach" of procedure, meaning City
OL,14,FHall could not ensure value for money.
OL,26,@tD@OOUuD@GO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G2/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,377,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1785761309
OL,3,CLondon mayor's office acted lawfully
OL,4,Cwhen blocking Met Palantir deal, court
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FThe company, founded by tech magnate
OL,8,FPeter Thiel, is now suing Mopac at the
OL,9,FHigh Court, claiming in court
OL,10,Fdocuments that the body introduced an
OL,11,F"unlawful veto" by considering
OL,12,FPalantir's "values and ethics", which
OL,13,Fwas an "irrelevant consideration".
OL,26,@sD@AOUsD@OO]tD@LOUtD@^O]uD@HOUuD@aO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G3/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,377,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37604
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1785761309
OL,3,CLondon mayor's office acted lawfully
OL,4,Cwhen blocking Met Palantir deal, court
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FIn a defence to the claim filed on
OL,8,FThursday, Joseph Barrett KC, for
OL,9,FMopac, denied the allegation, stating:
OL,10,F"The decision was not taken on the
OL,11,Fbasis of Palantir's 'values and
OL,12,Fethics' or a mismatch between those
OL,13,Fvalues/ethics and the values of
OL,14,FLondoners."
OL,16,FHe continued that the decision was
OL,17,Ftaken as the Met's process to award
OL,18,Fthe contract was unlawful or "gave
OL,19,Frise to an acceptable risk of
OL,20,Funlawfulness".
OL,26,@rD@AOUvD@KO]zD@^OU|D@MO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G4/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,377,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1785761309
OL,3,CLondon mayor's office acted lawfully
OL,4,Cwhen blocking Met Palantir deal, court
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FHe said: "In the premises, the
OL,8,Fdecision was the only decision which
OL,9,F(Mopac) could lawfully and/or
OL,10,Frealistically reach.
OL,12,F"In any event, (Mopac) would lawfully
OL,13,Fhave come to the same decision."
OL,15,FMr Barrett also said that the Met did
OL,16,Fnot obtain Mopac's approval for its
OL,17,Fprocurement strategy, in breach of
OL,18,Frules.
OL,26,@oD@JOUtD@AOUuD@`O]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G5/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,377,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1785761309
OL,3,CLondon mayor's office acted lawfully
OL,4,Cwhen blocking Met Palantir deal, court
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FHe continued that the force
OL,8,F"repeatedly, it is inferred
OL,9,Fintentionally, provided Mopac with
OL,10,Finaccurate, misleading and/or
OL,11,Finconsistent information" in relation
OL,12,Fto its procurement strategy and its
OL,13,Fdealings with Palantir.
OL,15,FHe said: "The decision was rational,
OL,16,Fproportionate, and based on relevant
OL,17,Fconsiderations.
OL,26,@pD@AOUsD@YO]wD@JOU
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G6/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,377,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37607
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1785761309
OL,3,CLondon mayor's office acted lawfully
OL,4,Cwhen blocking Met Palantir deal, court
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,F"Palantir's claim is a crude attempt
OL,8,Fto substitute its own views and/or
OL,9,Fthose of the Metropolitan Police for
OL,10,Fthe judgment of the responsible
OL,11,Fdecision-maker."
OL,13,FAI technology is already available to
OL,14,Fother forces, the NHS and the Ministry
OL,15,Fof Defence, with the Met warning after
OL,16,FMopac's decision that it would have to
OL,17,Freduce officer numbers.
OL,19,FThe Met has since begun working on a
OL,20,Fnew procurement process for the
OL,21,Fcontract.
OL,26,@oD@AOUsD@PO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G7/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,377,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37608
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1785761309
OL,3,CLondon mayor's office acted lawfully
OL,4,Cwhen blocking Met Palantir deal, court
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FLord Pannick KC, for Palantir,
OL,8,Fpreviously said that Mopac's
OL,9,Fassessment of Palantir's "values and
OL,10,Fethics" had played an "unlawful and
OL,11,Fnon-transparent role" in the decision-
OL,12,Fmaking process, claiming that Mopac
OL,13,Fhas "not acted transparently in
OL,14,Fdisclosing the correct or complete
OL,15,Freasons for the decision".
OL,17,FHe continued that this meant the
OL,18,Fdecision was "irrational,
OL,19,Fdisproportionate, and is based on
OL,20,Firrelevant considerations".
OL,26,@qD@ZOUrD@GO]rD@WOUsD@UO]uD@EOUwD@YO]zD@
OL,26,ANOU|D@ZO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G8/9
OL,2,W+,"-'*%/*-'"-'*%/T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BLondon NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,377,370,120,260,000,100
PN,37609
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F376A1785761309
OL,3,CLondon mayor's office acted lawfully
OL,4,Cwhen blocking Met Palantir deal, court
OL,5,Ctold
OL,7,FThe barrister also said that Mopac's
OL,8,Fclaim that its decision was based on
OL,9,Fthe Met not informing it of the
OL,10,Fforce's procurement strategy and that
OL,11,Fthe deal did not represent value for
OL,12,Fmoney was "manifestly erroneous".
OL,14,FPalantir is seeking "a declaration
OL,15,Fthat (Mopac) has acted unlawfully, an
OL,16,Forder quashing the decision, and an
OL,17,Forder that the contract be awarded to
OL,18,Fthe claimant".
OL,20,FA full hearing in the case is expected
OL,21,Fto take place next January.
OL,26,@tD@KOUtD@`O]vD@UOUzD@MO]
OL,1,W h7}h7}j7}h7}h7}                 G9/9
